+# Transport Compression Codec
+
+This project has no recorded decision specifying a transport compression codec. No policy, changelog entry, or design document in this repository designates a codec for transport compression; compression, when used, is left to community middleware (e.g. gin-contrib) rather than a codec chosen and recorded by the project itself.
